{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"Swami","modules":[{"name":"Swami"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","title":"Swami","symbolKind":"module","role":"collection"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch graph and SwiftUI are both reactive dataflow. Swami targets SwiftUI’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"state graph (computed properties, "},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"withAnimation","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") rather than imperative"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"functions, so the two graphs stay aligned. Where a native SwiftUI construct maps"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cleanly, Swami uses it. Where Origami’s semantics need a helper — for example the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Interaction patch’s four discrete output ports, or Drag’s momentum + rubber-band","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"physics — Swami ships a helper named after the Origami patch and shaped like it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Corpus-in-progress-2-of-69","type":"heading","text":"Corpus (in progress — 2 of 69)"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The translated corpus is the gallery and the training set. Each entry is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verified SwiftUI translation of an Origami pattern."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Interaction","type":"heading","text":"Interaction"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"doc:Interaction_Touch","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swami"]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Beats"],"title":"Reference","anchor":"Reference"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Drag"],"title":"Helpers","anchor":"Helpers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/TouchOrigamiExampleView","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"],"title":"Examples","anchor":"Examples"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag"],"generated":true,"title":"Articles","anchor":"Articles"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/SwiftUICore"],"generated":true,"title":"Extended Modules","anchor":"Extended-Modules"}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftU